<title>LATVIA: OLAINFARM, UNIBANKA GAIN AT SHARE PRICE FIXING.</title>
<headline>OLAINFARM, UNIBANKA GAIN AT SHARE PRICE FIXING.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
